places:
    place-raventree-hall:
        name: Raventree Hall
        parent: place-the-riverlands
        type: castle
        properties:
            seat_of: House Blackwood
        notes: Seat of House Blackwood in the Riverlands. The Blackwoods worship the Old Gods, unusual south of the Neck. Features a dead weirwood in its godswood where hundreds of ravens roost.
